'''Meltdown''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 19th tier in the Battle Pass during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has the default knife mesh. Its blade is yellow with green goo oozing down from the top. A meltdown symbol is imprinted on it by the bolster, hence the name. The guard and handle are also yellow, but the handle has a hatch pattern over it.
